---
const WHATSAPP_NUMBER = "233547000817";
const WHATSAPP_URL = `https://wa.me/${WHATSAPP_NUMBER}?text=Hi%20Helthe%20Juice!%20I%27d%20like%20to%20place%20an%20order%20%F0%9F%A7%83`;
---

<div class="section-faq">
  <div class="container wrapper">
    <div class="text-center">
      <h2 class="heading-secondary">FAQs</h2>
      <p class="text-white mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">Everything you need to know about ordering, delivery, and our juices.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto faq-container">
      <div data-ui-tablist class="ui-accordion" data-ui-transition="collapse">

        <!-- faq-1 -->
        <div class="ui-accordion-item">
          <button data-ui-tablist-tab class="ui-accordion-header">
            How do I place an order?
          </button>
          <div data-ui-tablist-tabpanel>
            <div class="ui-accordion-body">
              Simply send us a WhatsApp message on <strong>+233 54 700 0817</strong> with your chosen flavours, quantity, and delivery address. Order by Friday to receive fresh delivery from Wednesday the following week. Pay by Friday to secure your slot.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- faq-2 -->
        <div class="ui-accordion-item">
          <button data-ui-tablist-tab class="ui-accordion-header">
            What sizes and formats are available?
          </button>
          <div data-ui-tablist-tabpanel hidden>
            <div class="ui-accordion-body">
              We offer four formats: <strong>Regular Juice (350ml) at 35 GHS</strong>, <strong>150ml Pouch at 150 GHS</strong>, <strong>Smoothie at 80 GHS</strong>, and <strong>3 Litre Bulk at 300 GHS</strong>. We also have bundle packs — the Juice Box (15 bottles, 525 GHS), Set of 20 (700 GHS), and the Drink the Rainbow pack (26 bottles, 950 GHS).
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- faq-3 -->
        <div class="ui-accordion-item">
          <button data-ui-tablist-tab class="ui-accordion-header">
            When do you deliver and how does it work?
          </button>
          <div data-ui-tablist-tabpanel hidden>
            <div class="ui-accordion-body">
              Orders placed and paid by <strong>Friday</strong> are delivered fresh from <strong>Wednesday the following week</strong>. Since our juices are 100% natural with no preservatives, we make them fresh per order to ensure maximum quality and nutrition.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- faq-4 -->
        <div class="ui-accordion-item">
          <button data-ui-tablist-tab class="ui-accordion-header">
            Can I order in bulk for my business or event?
          </button>
          <div data-ui-tablist-tabpanel hidden>
            <div class="ui-accordion-body">
              Yes! We handle bulk orders of up to <strong>1,000 bottles</strong> with a 2-week lead time. For events, we also offer <strong>5kg bags at 500 GHS</strong> — perfect for large gatherings. DM us on WhatsApp or Instagram <strong>@helthejuicegh</strong> to arrange.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- faq-5 -->
        <div class="ui-accordion-item">
          <button data-ui-tablist-tab class="ui-accordion-header">
            What is Helthe RX?
          </button>
          <div data-ui-tablist-tabpanel hidden>
            <div class="ui-accordion-body">
              Helthe RX is our custom blend service. Tell us what your body needs — whether it's post-delivery recovery, travel prep, immunity boost, stress relief, energy, or detox — and we'll craft a blend specifically for you. Just send us a message to get started.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- faq-6 -->
        <div class="ui-accordion-item">
          <button data-ui-tablist-tab class="ui-accordion-header">
            Are your juices really 100% natural?
          </button>
          <div data-ui-tablist-tabpanel hidden>
            <div class="ui-accordion-body">
              Absolutely. Every Helthe juice is made from fresh fruit with <strong>zero preservatives, zero artificial colours, and zero added sugar</strong>. What you taste is exactly what went in — pure, honest fruit. That's why we make fresh batches per order rather than keeping stock on a shelf.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- faq-7 -->
        <div class="ui-accordion-item">
          <button data-ui-tablist-tab class="ui-accordion-header">
            How many flavours can I choose in a bundle?
          </button>
          <div data-ui-tablist-tabpanel hidden>
            <div class="ui-accordion-body">
              The <strong>Juice Box (15 bottles)</strong> allows up to 2 flavours. The <strong>Set of 20</strong> allows up to 3 flavours. The <strong>Drink the Rainbow (26 bottles)</strong> covers all flavour categories — it's the full Helthe experience in one pack.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    

  </div>
</div>


<style lang="scss">
.section-faq {
  padding: 8rem 0 15rem;
  background-color: var(--clr-yellow);
  color: var(--clr-white);
  border-bottom: 1px solid #647065;
}

.faq-container {
  background-color: #2F2C2C;
  padding: 2rem 1rem;
  border-radius: 1rem;
}

.ui-accordion-header {
  background-color: #3f3c3c;
  padding: 1rem;
  border-radius: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: .5rem;
  width: 100%;
  text-align: left;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #4a4a4a;

  &:hover {
    color: var(--clr-orange);
  }
}

.ui-accordion-header:where(.ui-active) {
  color: yellow;
}

.ui-accordion-body {
  padding: 0.5rem 1rem 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  color: #d1d1d1;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.whatsapp-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  background-color: #25D366;
  color: white;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
  border-radius: 9999px;
  font-size: 1rem;
  transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;

  &:hover {
    background-color: #1ebe5d;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
}
</style>